            "detailed_description": "<strong>Story</strong><br><br>Space of Darkness tells the story of a mechanic who works on a space station. The mechanic is alone on the ship for a few months. One day the power suddenly cuts off. He soon finds himself alone in the dark corridors of a space station. Can you unearth what truly happened on the space station? Are you able to find the small Space Ship and help the partner crew?<br><br><br><strong>About</strong><br><br>you are a mechanic who wants to find out what happened on the space station, it will be a little adventure that awaits him a space station full of unexpected surprises, explore, make quests, collect stuff and survive!<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Low-Poly Graphics<br></li><li> Jump-Scares<br></li><li> Loot<br></li><li> Letters<br></li><li> Enemys<br></li><li>Hotbar<br></li><li> Flashlight System<br></li><li> Achievements<br></li><li> and more!</li></ul>",
